---
layout: layout.njk
title: Obras
description: "Libros e investigación de Felipe Carvajal Brown: sistemas multiagente con LLM, simulación numérica y un libro de dibujos."
lang: es
bodyClass: page-editorial
altUrl: /en/
---
<div class="editorial-body">
    <p class="editorial-eyebrow">Obras</p>
    <h1 class="editorial-title">Libros e <em>investigación</em>.</h1>
    <p class="editorial-lede">Dos libros y cuatro trabajos de investigación, de los sistemas multiagente con LLM a la simulación numérica. Pasa el cursor o toca una portada para ver su ficha.</p>

    {% for shelf in works.shelves %}
    <h2 class="works-heading">{{ shelf.heading }}</h2>
    <ul class="works-shelf">
        {% for w in shelf.items %}
        <li class="work-card">
            <div class="work-inner">
                <div class="work-face work-front" style="--cover: {{ w.cover }}">
                    <span class="work-cover-kind">{{ w.kind }}</span>
                    <span class="work-cover-title">{{ w.title }}</span>
                    <span class="work-cover-author">{{ w.authors }}</span>
                </div>
                <div class="work-face work-back">
                    <span class="work-back-kind">{{ w.kind }} · {{ w.year }}</span>
                    <span class="work-back-title">{{ w.title }}</span>
                    <span class="work-back-line">{{ w.authors }}</span>
                    <span class="work-back-line">{{ w.language }}</span>
                    {% if w.note %}<span class="work-back-line">{{ w.note }}</span>{% endif %}
                    {% if w.doi %}<a class="work-back-link" href="https://doi.org/{{ w.doi }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">DOI {{ w.doi }}</a>{% endif %}
                </div>
            </div>
        </li>
        {% endfor %}
    </ul>
    {% endfor %}
</div>
<script src="/works.js" defer></script>
